        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eliya aba giijeeda Sinayi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwarukusa Ahabu Yesebeli ng'asheega sean sin Eliya, ea gidanuusta sibanga aba ng'uta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goojeaksa Yesebeli giijasoocheanda heeda Eliya, nea gwayeesha, “Gagasa gwasinnean aseecheeka, ea suuk gea saang'a inyas meanung' gawuurji eaweagaagu geaba siyagi aba jeenyaawa numuji damanda uurji ghamneawa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu ghang'ut muuwda, ak ghang'eat ghaweat eaweagaaschi, ghwahita Beer-sheba was mujiineeda Yuda, ak ghwanung'wa siidaanyi bea gadiyeeda hoowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gawa niny beata askwearjeanda asagi weah jeeda dareapcheeda, ghwaan ak goopteada aba guumda geeta ak gamus miyeeda nea gwayi, “Nideay, ghamneawa, Ea NG'UTAMIIDA, geanda eaweegeasu; aba gideaba aniini meawoosi doabiiwaat ea dang'al ghweanigeasu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gawiil geaw ak gwalil aba guumda geeta; ak ging'ulayi, ghwasat giijasoocheanda humng'eeda, ak gwayeesha, “Ng'eada agiischeena.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghoang'wearda ak ghwadaah, gwanda uhuudaanyi mukaateeyda siiwu aba badayda lagheanga ea gweeriida beega. Ak gweagiischi ak gwaleeshi, ak gawiil geaw gicha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwahidu giijasoocheanda humng'eeda deabiyeenya, ak ghawas, ak gwayeesha, “Ng'eada agiischeena, aba gideaba naweani gajea geaw muuchi aba headaang'u.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat, ak gweagiischi ak gwaleeshi, ak ghabeawa uurdeaba hamitida aba eawooji haradam askweari ea eawa nea gaweesa Horebu was giijeeda ASEETA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aba hoowa gawa jeeda gwaleeda, ak gwalil aba hoowa; ak ging'ulayi, ghwahidu ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA headaanyi, ak gwayeesha, “Gisin naaha aba hiji, Eliya?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha, “Aniini naalaji ghuut aba badayda NG'UTAMIIDA, ASEETA bea lugweega; aba gideaba fuga Israeli nihista neajeadaang'u, ak gwanyarja headaang'u bea wagiida, ak ghabwar sibangaagu aba ng'uta; nea aniini ea siipuudan, aniini ak ghwahit, nea saawa ghamneawa gagasa gageanda eaweegeasu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha, “Rita ak guwi uhuuda giijeeda aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA,” Ak ging'ulayi ghang'ata NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ghwahidu jeameeda hoauur ak gwadukuta giijeega, ak gwanyarjeaweada lagheanga aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ea manda NG'UTAMIIDA jeeda jeameeda; iing'ata jeameeda ghwahidu giighweendandeeda humng'eeda; ak NG'UTAMIIDA ea manda jeeda giighweendandeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata gighweendandeeda ghwahidu beasta, ak ea manda NG'UTAMIIDA jeeda beasta; ama ng'ata beasta ghwahidu nyeashta mwanang'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwayiiy Eliya, gwadukuta gheanyangaaschi aba hang'weakaaschi ak gwarita ak ghamiinaada aba ghuuta gwaleeda. Ak ging'ulayi, ghwahidu headaanyi nyeashta, ak gwayi, “Gisini naaha aba hiji, Eliya?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha, “Aniini ghaalaji ghuut badayda NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA bea lugweega; aba gideaba fuga Israeli nijakta neajeadaang'u nea gwanyarja heeda wagiida, ak ghabwar sibangaagu gameewa aba ng'uta; nea aniini ea siipuudan, aniini ak ghwahit; nea saawa ghamneawa gagasa gageanda eaweegeasu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA, “Una biikta naweeda dareapcheeda Dameski, inyas gihiti, gimwaari Hasaeli ghoah sugoocheanda Shaamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Yehuheeda was orjeeda Nimshi gajamwaara ghoah sugoocheanda Israeli; nea Elishaheeda was orjeeda Shafati bea ng'eanyiida Abel-mehola amwaara ghoah sibaneeda jea gawa hoorgeadaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak siisi nyooh ghaghuuha ng'uta Hasaeli gaygwanuus Yehu; nea gilinyoo ghaghu aba heeda ng'uta Yehu gaygwanuus Elisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydaabuut fih sagalamnyooji ispwa aba ng'eanyiida Israeli, was gutung'weaka sean mii gwahiiysa geat Baali, ea giliwas ghuuta miighwasam Baali.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Guursiinda Elisha",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchu ghang'eada hoowa, ak gwaroonyi sea Elishayda was orjeeda Shafati; nea ghabwar ng'eanyi aba heewga yookaji damaniyeenya bea heewga aba madeadaanyi nea niny gwandeawa damaniyeenya. Hean ghwala Eliya murdeadaanyi ak gwajaksa hang'daanyi badaydaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwanung'wa heeda heewga, ak ghafwaja geeshta Eliya, ak gwayeesha, “Nung' ghanyi dasam gheata bwaabwa ea iya, ak abeeda gaydeadu geeshtaang'u.” Hean gwayeesha Eliya, “Una biikta, neada geahindaneeyiin?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gabiikna eadita geeshtaanyi, ak gageanda yookajeega heewga, ak gwanuuseada ak ghoawaala banyeega nyaawa yookajeega heewga, ak ghoadaw buuneeda, ak ghwaak. Hean ghang'eat ak ghwaat geeshta Eliya, ak gagadiiyeesa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
